{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Can I tell you something I'm bad at?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2530,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am terrible at making clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5500,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Up until two years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6650,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my most popular video\nwas about a basketball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9110,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being dropped from a dam\nwith a bit of backspin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12010,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It takes off like a rocket and shoots out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14400,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way further than you'd expect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16560,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was embedded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18190,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on literally hundreds of news websites."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20700,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in its first week, it\ngot 16.3 million views,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25320,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but almost none of those views\ncame on the YouTube platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29200,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30130,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I gave it this thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32560,
    "dDurationMs": 3357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I called it \"Strange\nApplications of the Magnus Effect.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37470,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video is sponsored by KiwiCo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39630,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More about them at the end of the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42120,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I believe within YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43610,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm used as an example of how\nnot to package your video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47240,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As if to demonstrate just how bad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48880,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a title and thumbnail this is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50320,
    "dDurationMs": 2817,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "someone else re-uploaded the\nvideo with the clever title,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53137,
    "dDurationMs": 2413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Basketball Dropped From Dam.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55550,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And within a few weeks,\nthat video had received"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58240,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tens of millions of views on YouTube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61010,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is when YouTube gave\nme access to ContentID."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63410,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the system that\nallows you to earn revenue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65560,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when someone else re-uploads\nyour videos, which was good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68890,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I still wasn't very good at clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71740,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for this video, I called in an expert."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74730,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to see your reaction face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76650,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you give me like a reaction face?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77970,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like what's a good thumbnail face?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79100,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, I got you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80150,
    "dDurationMs": 1946,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a thumbnail face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82096,
    "dDurationMs": 2124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84220,
    "dDurationMs": 4065,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have like 10, I go through\nthe motions of like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88285,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90065,
    "dDurationMs": 995,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we just take the best one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91060,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I probably have like\n500 of these just saved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93560,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we can just Photoshop\nmy face on my face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96290,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way, I don't have to do it anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98360,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When I started on this\nplatform, some 10 years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101460,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clickbait was less important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103120,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Subscribers were what mattered,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105090,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because most of the views\ncame from the sub feed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107800,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And videos went viral usually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109480,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by getting a lot of attention elsewhere,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111090,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like on Reddit or Facebook,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113000,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not due to the YouTube algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114860,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once you had a big\nvideo and people subscribed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117810,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, then your next video\nwould likely get a lot of views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120080,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from those subscribers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121280,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So YouTube would take that popular video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123210,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and share it with more people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124420,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you'd get more subscribers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a positive feedback loop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129240,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But soon, YouTube realized\nthat this did not create"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132020,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the best experience for the viewer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134110,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They discovered that\nshowing people only videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137050,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from channels they were\nsubscribed to led to fewer clicks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140240,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less watch time and less engagement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142690,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the site as a whole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144250,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, they knew that\nrelying on other platforms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146250,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to drive traffic to viral hits was risky,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148800,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since those other platforms might disable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150560,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the traffic at any time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152230,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they needed to make YouTube\na destination in itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155990,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They wanted people to come to YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158000,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see videos that interested them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159900,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "click on at least one of them\nand watch it for a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162620,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ideally get sucked down\nthe YouTube rabbit hole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165430,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and spend hours on the site\nwithout even noticing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168770,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ultimate resource is people's time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170960,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and attention, and every platform"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172620,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is trying to capture as\nmuch of it as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176430,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, to make YouTube\nthis go-to destination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178690,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they had decrease the\nimportance of subscribers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181420,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make it less like a podcast app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183160,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you only get the\nshows you're subscribed to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185160,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and more like Reddit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186530,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where stuff with the most\nengagement rises to the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190260,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that necessarily meant increasing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192430,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the importance of clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194740,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, there seems to be a paradox\nwhen it comes to clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197850,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People almost universally\nclaim to hate it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201130,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you also see it everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203850,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why is this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205600,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, one of the problems\nis we don't all agree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207740,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the definition of clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209390,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I google it, the top definition is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211900,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the internet, content\nwhose main purpose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214240,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to attract attention\nand encourage visitors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216790,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to click on a link to\na particular webpage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219360,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We could call this type I clickbait,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222050,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there doesn't seem to\nbe anything wrong with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224410,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you didn't\ntry to attract attention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226980,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and get people to click on your links,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228280,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you wouldn't really\nbe doing your job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230400,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is a second definition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232290,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One that I think more people ascribe to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234950,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is something such\nas a headline designed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237410,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make readers want to\nclick on a hyperlink,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239760,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially when the link leads to content"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241820,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of dubious value or interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244280,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wikipedia says, \"A defining\ncharacteristic of clickbait"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247090,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that it is sensationalized\nor misleading.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249980,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it also talks about teasers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251820,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that intentionally withhold information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253520,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to exploit the \"curiosity gap.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255640,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They give you enough\ninformation to make you curious,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258200,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not enough to satisfy that curiosity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261330,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are two actual titles\nfrom a news website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265060,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nine out of 10 Americans\nare completely wrong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267730,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about this mind blowing fact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270200,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And someone gave some kids some scissors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272630,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's what happened next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274920,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we can all agree\nthat these are examples"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276950,
    "dDurationMs": 1503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of bad type II clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279350,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, imagine a clickbait\nspace where on one axis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282170,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have how misleading\nor sensationalized it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285630,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on the other, how much information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287630,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is intentionally withheld\nto create a curiosity gap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290880,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, then these two titles\nfall in the top right corner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294180,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And these are the zones\nof type II clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297740,
    "dDurationMs": 970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the other extreme,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298710,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have things that are so\nunsensationalized as to be dull."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302730,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could call this the dead zone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305550,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, here is where you would find"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307727,
    "dDurationMs": 2923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Strange applications\nof the Magnus Effect.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310650,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, I didn't tell you\nwhat the applications were."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313750,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, in the middle is where you\nwould find type I clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317980,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But honestly, I think type\nI and type II clickbait"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320230,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are so different, that\nwe shouldn't even use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322440,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same word for them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323990,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of type I clickbait,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325600,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my friend and YouTuber, Brady\nHeron suggested legitbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329440,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it might sound\nenticing, but it is legit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333310,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of type II clickbait,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334730,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we could use clicktrap,\nclicktrick, linktrap or dupechute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340860,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's important to recognize\nis that for any given video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343940,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is no one true title and thumbnail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347170,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each video could have\nhundreds or thousands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349760,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of different legitbait titles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351760,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, how does a zero-G plane work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355070,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went on a plane that does\nparabolic trajectories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358440,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happens to fire on a zero-G plane?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361970,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the most enticing\ntitles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364160,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are found close to type II clickbait."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367150,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm reminded of the infographic\nby smarter every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369560,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "showing that on social media,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371270,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the greatest engagement\noccurs close to the boundary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373620,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what's allowable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374950,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But remember that everyone's\ndefinition of clickbait"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377430,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is different, and everyone's perceptions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379260,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of words and images are different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380970,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these are not clear boundaries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382850,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're actually kind of fuzzy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385200,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What for one person might be legitbait,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387270,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for someone else, could be a clicktrap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390240,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's clear is that on a site"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392040,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where click-through rate is important,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393960,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clickbait of all types is inevitable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396270,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How important to a video's success"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398760,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the title and thumbnail?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400000,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Very important. Of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401430,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they don't click on the video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402263,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't watch it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403430,
    "dDurationMs": 2477,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't get 10 million views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405907,
    "dDurationMs": 2193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unless 10 million people\nclick on the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408100,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I mean, it's literally that simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410930,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't click on it,\nthey don't watch it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412630,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, why is clickbait everywhere?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415090,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, because it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417300,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More enticing thumbnails get more clicks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419700,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite some people's claims"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421230,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they won't click or they'll unsub,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423430,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's just like evolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424950,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whatever survives, multiplies\nand traits become amplified."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429100,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you don't begrudge\nthe giraffe its long neck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431720,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it can reach the highest leaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433630,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can you begrudge a YouTuber the red arrow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436070,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that allows them to\nreach further audiences?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438870,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I talked about this in\nmy video two years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441000,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To be successful as a YouTuber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442540,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to optimize two things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444440,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watch time and the click-through\nrate of your videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447140,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the number of times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448460,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the title and thumbnail are clicked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449730,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "divided by the total number\nof times they're shown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452000,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the number of impressions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454130,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now at the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454963,
    "dDurationMs": 2177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this was something of a revelation for me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457140,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I always thought my\njob was to make great videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459910,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then a title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461210,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that adequately represented\nwhat the video was about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463840,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now I've realized that\nmaking the title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466640,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is at least half the job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469220,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is not just because\nbetter titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471570,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get you more clicks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472700,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but because better titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474140,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will get you way more impressions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477160,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube has limited real estate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479260,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with which to show you\nvirtually infinite content."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482280,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so it's not enough\nto make a good video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484350,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if people watch all of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486130,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you also have to make\na title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488270,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gets clicked,\nespecially in competition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490140,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with other really good\ntitles and thumbnails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492700,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the only way you can expect YouTube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494440,
    "dDurationMs": 2108,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to give you more impressions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496548,
    "dDurationMs": 2732,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the big development\nsince my last video on this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499280,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is YouTube introduced real-time metrics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501780,
    "dDurationMs": 2523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like views, impressions\nand click-through rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504303,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I suggested this\nwould create an arms race."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506770,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you can bet will happen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508470,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that creators will launch a video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510680,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they'll be sitting there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511690,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with all these different\nvariants of thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513640,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they'll be swapping them out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515380,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and looking at what that\ndoes to click-through rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518030,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then going with the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519740,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that leads to the greatest\nclick-through rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522610,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is basically what has happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525210,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me give you my favorite example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527410,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Last year, I made a video about asteroids,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530020,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I thought was really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531710,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I called it \"Asteroids:\nEarth's Biggest Threat,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534930,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is something Stephen Hawking said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536650,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And people were very\npositive about the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538930,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They thought it was maybe one of my best,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541200,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the performance\nwas well below average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543950,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In its first day,\nasteroids was ranked ninth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546720,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out of my previous 10 videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549080,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was probably on target"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550480,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for about one and a half million views."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553070,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I tried different titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555270,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, \"Asteroid Impact:\nWhat Are Our Chances?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558130,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or \"Asteroid Impact: What Could We Do?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560820,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But none of these changes\ngot much traction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563850,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then on day three after launch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565520,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I changed the title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567010,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to \"These Are the\nAsteroids to Worry About.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570650,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And immediately the video\nstarted doing better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573480,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It quickly shot up from almost\nmy worst performing video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576980,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to my best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578720,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It now has 14 million views."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582030,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing about the video changed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583790,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just that one image and 38 characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587130,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because of that, the video has reached"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589180,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nearly 10 times as many people\nas it otherwise would have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592820,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the title and thumbnail\naccurately describe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595100,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what the video is about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596490,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, sure, there's a curiosity gap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598700,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you couldn't explain the whole concept"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600740,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the length of the title."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602550,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you see a YouTuber\nchanging titles and thumbnails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605550,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607070,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that effort can be\nrewarded many times over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610250,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've seen people\nobjecting to this practice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612020,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they think the creator"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613380,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is trying to dupe their audience,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614730,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get them to click on the\nsame video more than once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616700,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that's not it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618780,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The whole point is to get YouTube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620410,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to show the title and\nthumbnail to more people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622610,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're trying to increase\nthe number of impressions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625650,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is heavily dependent\non the click-through rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628630,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, a lot of my recent videos\nhave this typical view curve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632470,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's an initial spike\nafter I release the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634690,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then a dip, and then a second bump"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637020,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after I have figured out a\nbetter title and thumbnail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640130,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I change the title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641580,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I watch the real time view graph."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644150,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I'm looking for is a\nnoticeable bump in views."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647480,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes there's no change,\nsometimes it gets worse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651050,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but on occasions, when you\nsee something like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653720,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well then, you know you've found a winner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656520,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is something all the\nbig YouTubers are doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658810,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not even Mr. Beast knows exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660430,
    "dDurationMs": 2469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which thumbnail will work best beforehand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662899,
    "dDurationMs": 2848,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you ever changed\na title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665747,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the video did better?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666580,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667760,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So everybody, I usually make\nlike two or three thumbnails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670290,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then if it's not\ndoing as well as I want,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672000,
    "dDurationMs": 3262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we usually just swap 'em out\nand see if it does better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675262,
    "dDurationMs": 2438,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause the thing is like,\nyou don't really know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677700,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you could know if you\njust were an almighty being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681190,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could just predict what\npeople would be interested in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683800,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you know, usually..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685280,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you can do hide and seek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686350,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't really know if\nlike you hiding in a tree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688810,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then someone walking\nbelow you is a good thumbnail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690850,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or if you hiding a trash can and\nthem walking in front of you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693350,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, just do both"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694750,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then see which one interests\npeople a little bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697210,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I feel the same way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698043,
    "dDurationMs": 2147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I do feel like you have a better sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700190,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of this than like most people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702080,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702913,
    "dDurationMs": 2679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, no one gets 40\nmillion views a video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705592,
    "dDurationMs": 1708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(both laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707300,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But what is the point\nin getting more views?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710360,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're cynical,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711193,
    "dDurationMs": 2617,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might say it's all\nabout money and fame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713810,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while there are certainly\nfinancial incentives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716080,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to getting more views,\nthat's not why I do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718860,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As an educational YouTuber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720360,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think there are two very good reasons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722370,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for using excellent type I clickbait"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724840,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over more straightforward packaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727110,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To understand the first reason,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728550,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's consider two\ndifferent possible titles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730710,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for my most recent video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732360,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I called it \"The Simplest Math\nProblem No One Can Solve,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736020,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's a video about\nthe Collatz conjecture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738350,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So perhaps a more straightforward title"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740470,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have been simply to call it that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742810,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem is, if I publish a video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744570,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called the Collatz conjecture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746500,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the most likely people to click on it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748450,
    "dDurationMs": 3197,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are those who already know\nwhat the Collatz conjecture is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751647,
    "dDurationMs": 3103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the vast majority of people\nwill never have heard of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754750,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for them, the title is meaningless"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757210,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and only the very curious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759020,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or those who really like\nVeritasium would click."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761800,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast, calling it\n\"The Simplest Math Problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764230,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No One Can Solve,\"\nconveys more information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766830,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the video to everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768800,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this means more\npeople can click on it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770780,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most of whom will never have heard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772280,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the Collatz conjecture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773320,
    "dDurationMs": 2532,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I get to teach them something new."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775852,
    "dDurationMs": 2938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since the video has a\nhigher click-through rate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778790,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube shows it to even more people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781000,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if my aim is to increase\nthe level of knowledge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784110,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the world by the\nmaximum amount possible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786940,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is the way to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789660,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second reason we need to\noptimize titles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792050,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to support the major\ngoal of this channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794920,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are trying to make\nthe best science films"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797120,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on every topic we tackle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799040,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That means traveling to meet\nexperts in film experiments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802480,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hiring people to build props,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804410,
    "dDurationMs": 4010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make spectacular animations,\nresearch and fact check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808420,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We hire expert consultants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810320,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to double and triple check our work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812700,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't wanna make vlogs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814110,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanna make science\ndocumentaries on YouTube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816260,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that put broadcast to shame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818220,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to make this possible and sustainable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820480,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the videos have to get\nviews and lots of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823360,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to do that, we have to make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824740,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the best titles and thumbnails we can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827360,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTuber and Patreon CEO, Jack Conte"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829590,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has talked about adjusting your packaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832000,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea is know what\nyou're passionate about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834310,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you won't compromise on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836000,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that stuff goes in the box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838270,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the rest, like what\npaper it's wrapped in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840740,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's the packaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842190,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the video is my focus\nand the title and thumbnail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844780,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the packaging that\nI'm happy to adjust,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847110,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I can make the type of\nvideos that are important to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850200,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, is it ironic that a\nchannel whose whole purpose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852590,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to promote a true seeking mindset"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854420,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has to experiment at the\nedge of what is truthful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857170,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to fulfill that purpose?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858940,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is something that I\noften worry about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861920,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, when I did like\nrisking my life to do X,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864880,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's like, well, what probability of death"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866480,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does there have to be for\nyou to risk your life?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868390,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like 50%?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869957,
    "dDurationMs": 2735,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I love how he always overthinks things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872692,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughs)\nThat's funny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873953,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's like, is my life risked enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876433,
    "dDurationMs": 2087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where I can put I risked my life?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878520,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I only had a 9% chance of dying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880250,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I need at least a 13% chance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882200,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're so funny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883350,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was the same way two years ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884950,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when he asked me all this stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886190,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was like, \"Dude, just do\nwhatever makes the most sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889690,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I mean, obviously\nI feel like my instincts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892390,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are not good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893590,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894530,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that I don't have\nto trust my instincts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897430,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This problem of getting the\nbest title and thumbnail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901460,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, it's a scientific problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903700,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're just asking which accurate\nrepresentation of the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906740,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will get the most clicks\nfrom a general audience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909610,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's a problem we can use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910730,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the scientific method to solve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912810,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've hired a couple\nof really bright people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914780,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we spend a lot of time brainstorming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916740,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and making titles and\nthumbnails and testing them out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919620,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, on Twitter and Patreon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921770,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Varitasium titles and\nthumbnails have gotten better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924090,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not because I'm better at it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925970,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but because of my team and our testing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928530,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have ideas about\nhow we could do it better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930610,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "please get in touch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932270,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The results have often\ncontradicted what I expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934860,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, this video seemed\nto perform 10% better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937890,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when we excluded the word\nsurprising from the title."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940750,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it became simply The\nSecret of Synchronization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944500,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought these two titles\nwere basically a toss up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947480,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Patreon had a strong\npreference for one over the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951220,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's interesting about this research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952960,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the more clickable\ntitles and thumbnails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955020,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "often better represent\nthe content of the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957720,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me give you some examples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959770,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing I didn't expect\nwhen YouTube brought in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961900,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the real time analytics tools"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963420,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and allowed title and thumbnail changes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964930,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to affect impressions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966660,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that it would also\nwork for older videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969400,
    "dDurationMs": 2727,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is an old video\nthat I originally entitled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972127,
    "dDurationMs": 3393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Why the Neutron is the\nHero of Nuclear Physics.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975520,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In hindsight, it's a weird,\nkinda meaningless title."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978840,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I changed it to, \"Why Einstein Thought"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981600,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nuclear Weapons Impossible.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983800,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's clearer, more accurate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985870,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what happened\nto views after the change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990510,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I changed \"Strange Applications\nof the Magnus Effect\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993380,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to \"Backspin Basketball Flies Off Dam.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996640,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, more accurate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997830,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the video is now\nbeing watched on YouTube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000830,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Probably 10 million more views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002850,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than it otherwise would have had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004720,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even anti-clickbait has proven effective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007440,
    "dDurationMs": 1927,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's a video I originally titled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009367,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Are Negative Ions Good For You?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011600,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is a question nobody asked ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015050,
    "dDurationMs": 3597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I changed it to,\n\"Do Salt Lamps Work?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020180,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seriously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021400,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's the result:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024330,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One and a half million more views."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027940,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think looking at these examples,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029620,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could easily make the case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030930,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that YouTube has made\nme better at what I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033980,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has improved the clarity and accuracy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036060,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of my titles and thumbnails.\nIt's helped me figure out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038320,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what is interesting to my audience"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039670,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how to encapsulate\nthat in a single image"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042120,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and fewer than 50 characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044230,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those of you who worry that a focus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046180,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on titles and thumbnails will prevent me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047720,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from picking challenging science topics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050580,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, I simply ask you\nto look at the videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053010,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the last year or two,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054440,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the ones on Gödel's\nincompleteness theorem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056580,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "general relativity, Penrose tilings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058560,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the logistic map, Newton's\nmethod of calculating Pi,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061720,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the one way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063640,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good titles and thumbnails\nmake it possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065850,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to tackle these topics\nand to reach more people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068610,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who have heard of them before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070790,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a symbiotic relationship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072630,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between views and video quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075160,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more views we get, the more people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076980,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "locations, props and equipment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079100,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and research we can invest in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081290,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This makes the next video\nbetter than the last."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084440,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we can be good at\ntitles and thumbnails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086620,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ultimate outcome is better videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089580,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is something I think\nyou and I both want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097800,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this video is sponsored by KiwiCo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100090,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a long time supporter of the channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102120,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now KiwiCo makes awesome\nhands on projects for kids,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1104760,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including big kids like me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106400,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have eight subscription lines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107760,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "targeted at different age groups,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109390,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the way down to newborns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111010,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I love about KiwiCo crates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112390,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that they make learning fun"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113710,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and something to look forward to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115200,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, when I pull out a crate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116900,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my kids just jump at the\nchance to make it with me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119470,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all the materials you\nneed come right in the box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122270,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's no need to run to the store."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123970,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just open it up and go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125940,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My kids and I just built\nthis domino machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128520,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which, who knows, might be\ninspiration for a viral video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132870,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the big idea is that\nwhile playing and having fun,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135440,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kids learn about STEAM concepts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137810,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is science, technology,\nengineering, art and math."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140890,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in addition to the project,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142180,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a magazine with a lot\nof additional information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144900,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think this is the best way to learn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146890,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By doing something\nyourself and having fun,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149220,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's how education should be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151200,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you wanna try it out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152210,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go to Kiwico.com/veritasium50,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154720,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll get 50% off your\nfirst month of any crate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157610,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will put that link\ndown in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159610,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna thank KiwiCo\nfor sponsoring Veritasium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1162160,
    "dDurationMs": 2408,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I wanna thank you for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
